• Uninstaller · {command}

programs.item.stale.description:
The uninstaller of this program and the folder it was installed in no longer exist (it was probably deleted by hand), so it cannot be uninstalled. Choosing it cleans that leftover instead: after you confirm, it removes the program's entry from the list of installed programs. No files are deleted, and a backup of the entry is saved first.
